OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 31 MAR
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GLinton Stephens introduces an
OL,6,     Gafternoon of specially made
OL,7,     Grecordings including Bruckner's
OL,8,     GSymphony No. 9 in D minor and
OL,9,     Grecent chamber music recordings
OL,10,     Gfrom the Crucible, Sheffield.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Hildegard
OL,12,     Fof Bingen and Isabella Leonarda
OL,13,     GLeonarda's talent flourishes
OL,14,     Gwithin the confines of her
OL,15,     Gconvent. With Donald Macleod.
OL,16,G1700FIn Tune
OL,17,     GKatie Derham is joined for a live
OL,18,     Gperformance by pianist Antoine
OL,19,     GPreat promoting his new album
OL,20,     G'Fortune's Fool'. Katie talks to
OL,21,     GPiers Kennedy about his new music
OL,22,     Gfor Holy Week.
