OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,6,     Gsoundscape of classical music,
OL,7,     Gfrom Handel to Nyman.
OL,8,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,9,     GThe BBC Scottish Symphony
OL,10,     GOrchestra and conductor Ryan
OL,11,     GWigglesworth are joined by Alban
OL,12,     GGerhardt for an all-British
OL,13,     Gprogramme.
OL,14,G2145FThe Essay: The Lives of Hildegard
OL,15,     Fof Bingen
OL,16,     GMedieval composer and polymath
OL,17,     GHildegard of Bingen remembers her
OL,18,     Glife as an anchoress. A
OL,19,     Gfictionalised account, written by
OL,20,     GAnna Linstrum and performed by
OL,21,     GJuliet Stevenson.
